{
  "info": {
    "name": "Smart Health · API REST",
    "description": "Colección de la API de Smart Health (Practical Assignment IoT 2026/27).\n\n**Antes de empezar:**\n1. Arranca la API (`npm run dev` en `api/`) y carga los jugadores (`node scripts/seed.js`).\n2. En las variables de la colección, pon en **Current value** las claves del `.env`: `claveMedico` = `API_KEY_MEDICO` y `clavePasarela` = `API_KEY_PASARELA`. El *Current value* no se exporta ni se sube al repo.\n3. Si la API no está en el puerto 3000, cambia `baseUrl`.\n\n**Variables que se rellenan solas:** `sesionId` (al empezar una sesión), `alertaId` (al listar alertas activas) y `ahora` (fecha actual para la telemetría).\n\nCada petición comprueba el código de respuesta, así que se puede lanzar entera con el *Collection Runner*.\nLa documentación interactiva está en `{{baseUrl}}/api-docs` y los contratos en `docs/contratos/`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "claveMedico",
      "value": "pon-aqui-API_KEY_MEDICO"
    },
    {
      "key": "clavePasarela",
      "value": "pon-aqui-API_KEY_PASARELA"
    },
    {
      "key": "jugadorId",
      "value": "p1"
    },
    {
      "key": "sesionId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "alertaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "ahora",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Utilidad",
      "description": "Comprobaciones rápidas.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('Mongo conectado', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().mongo).to.eql('connected'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Telemetría",
      "description": "Lo que manda la pasarela de Node-RED una vez por segundo (clave de la pasarela).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Enviar un lote",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('ahora', new Date().toISOString());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 202', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(202); });",
                  "pm.test('Recibe las 3 lecturas', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().recibidas).to.eql(3); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{clavePasarela}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/telemetria",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "telemetria"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lote con p1 y p8 en el formato del simulador de A, y p10 sin señal. `{{ahora}}` se rellena antes de enviarlo.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ts\": \"{{ahora}}\",\n  \"lecturas\": [\n    {\n      \"jugadorId\": \"p1\",\n      \"ts\": \"{{ahora}}\",\n      \"estado\": \"ok\",\n      \"sensors\": {\n        \"gps\": {\n          \"speed\": {\n            \"unit\": \"km/h\",\n            \"value\": 14.2\n          },\n          \"distancecovered\": {\n            \"unit\": \"m\",\n            \"value\": 2350\n          },\n          \"position\": {\n            \"X\": {\n              \"unit\": \"m\",\n              \"value\": 40.5\n            },\n            \"Y\": {\n              \"unit\": \"m\",\n              \"value\": 22.1\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"accelerometer\": {\n          \"acceleration\": {\n            \"unit\": \"m/s2\",\n            \"value\": 1.2\n          },\n          \"desacceleration\": {\n            \"unit\": \"m/s2\",\n            \"value\": 0\n          },\n          \"impact\": {\n            \"unit\": \"g\",\n            \"value\": 1.1\n          }\n        },\n        \"giroscope\": {\n          \"changeinposition\": {\n            \"unit\": \"degrees\",\n            \"value\": 12\n          }\n        },\n        \"pulsemeter\": {\n          \"pulse\": {\n            \"unit\": \"bpm\",\n            \"value\": 152\n          }\n        },\n        \"termometer\": {\n          \"temperature\": {\n            \"unit\": \"C\",\n            \"value\": 37.9\n          }\n        },\n        \"pressuresensor\": {\n          \"pressureleftfoot\": {\n            \"unit\": \"%\",\n            \"value\": 49\n          },\n          \"pressurerightfoot\": {\n            \"unit\": \"%\",\n            \"value\": 51\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"jugadorId\": \"p8\",\n      \"ts\": \"{{ahora}}\",\n      \"estado\": \"ok\",\n      \"sensors\": {\n        \"gps\": {\n          \"speed\": {\n            \"unit\": \"km/h\",\n            \"value\": 26.1\n          },\n          \"distancecovered\": {\n            \"unit\": \"m\",\n            \"value\": 3120\n          },\n          \"position\": {\n            \"X\": {\n              \"unit\": \"m\",\n              \"value\": 71\n            },\n            \"Y\": {\n              \"unit\": \"m\",\n              \"value\": 40.3\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"accelerometer\": {\n          \"acceleration\": {\n            \"unit\": \"m/s2\",\n            \"value\": 1.2\n          },\n          \"desacceleration\": {\n            \"unit\": \"m/s2\",\n            \"value\": 0\n          },\n          \"impact\": {\n            \"unit\": \"g\",\n            \"value\": 1.1\n          }\n        },\n        \"giroscope\": {\n          \"changeinposition\": {\n            \"unit\": \"degrees\",\n            \"value\": 12\n          }\n        },\n        \"pulsemeter\": {\n          \"pulse\": {\n            \"unit\": \"bpm\",\n            \"value\": 178\n          }\n        },\n        \"termometer\": {\n          \"temperature\": {\n            \"unit\": \"C\",\n            \"value\": 38.4\n          }\n        },\n        \"pressuresensor\": {\n          \"pressureleftfoot\": {\n            \"unit\": \"%\",\n            \"value\": 49\n          },\n          \"pressurerightfoot\": {\n            \"unit\": \"%\",\n            \"value\": 51\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"jugadorId\": \"p10\",\n      \"ts\": \"{{ahora}}\",\n      \"estado\": \"sin_senal\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
